    "reasoner_response": "Inform the customer that to start a new claim, the repair facility needs to contact the Claims department directly, as customers cannot initiate the claim themselves. Advise them to speak with their repair facility and have them reach out to Assurant Claims to begin the process. Ask if they have any other questions about rental car benefits or coverage.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
